        <UserObject label="When I was 8 years old I was told by my IT teacher in primary school that I should go on to the computer and use this program called &quot;Scratch&quot;. Shockingly, the computer turned out to be capable of more than playing Youtube videos. I had uncovered an entire universe where I was capable of creating worlds completely under my control. In other words, I could create a game." tags="story then" id="wNzVs3GtXIuLr2SUcsPN-96">
